  "body_html": "<h1>interimQuasiLinearUtility_eq_equilibriumPayoff_add</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem interimQuasiLinearUtility_eq_equilibriumPayoff_add (A : BayesianSingleItemAuction I) (i : I) (t_i z_i : ℝ) : A.interimQuasiLinearUtility i t_i z_i = A.equilibriumPayoff i z_i + A.interimAllocProb i z_i * (t_i - z_i)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>none</li>\n</ul>",
